. *                                       Contents:
. *                                               Part 1(a-b): Sales prices baseline + controls 
. *                                               Part 2(a-b): Rents baseline + controls 
. *                               
. * Inputs:               mt_orthogonal_dist_100m_07-01-22_moreregs.dta
. *                               within_town_analysis_data.dta
. *                               
. * Outputs:              log output only
. *
. * Created:              04/11/2024
. * Updated:      02/27/2025
. ********************************************************************************
